# Keep every text file in the repository byte-identical to what CI checks out.
# The release gates assert on literal LF newlines (for example the Actions workflow
# job block), and a CRLF checkout would make a local run disagree with the runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.fpk binary
*.woff2 binary
